.\" Manpage for proman
.TH PROMAN 1 "2026-11-01" "proman 0.3.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
proman \- standardized Git workflow & project launcher
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B proman
.I COMMAND
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fIARGS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B proman
is a CLI tool that simplifies Git operations, project cloning, and local registry management.
It can clone repositories, run project scripts, and manage SSH keys for GitLab/GitHub.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B integrate \fIprovider\fR [\fB\-\-hostname\fR|\fB\-H\fR \fIhost\fR]
Configure CLI authentication (glab/gh).
.TP
.B init \fIurl\fR [\fB\-\-name\fR|\fB\-n\fR \fIname\fR] [\fB\-\-dest\fR|\fB\-d\fR \fIdir\fR] [\fB\-\-duration\-key\fR|\fB\-k\fR]
Clone a repository, create run.pm.sh, and register it.
.TP
.B new \fIname\fR [\fB\-\-template\fR|\fB\-t\fR \fItemplate\fR] [\fB\-\-dest\fR|\fB\-d\fR \fIdir\fR]
Create a new project from a template.
.TP
.B save \fImessage\fR [\fB\-\-project\fR|\fB\-p\fR \fIname\fR]
Commit and push changes.
.TP
.B sync [\fB\-\-project\fR|\fB\-p\fR \fIname\fR]
Pull with rebase and push.
.TP
.B run \fIname\fR
Run the project's run.pm.sh script.
.TP
.B repath \fInew_path\fR
Re-bind a project to a new path.
.TP
.B move \fIname\fR \fInew_path\fR
Move a project folder and update the registry.
.TP
.B destroy \fIname\fR [\fB\-\-yes\fR|\fB\-y\fR]
Remove a project from the registry (and optionally delete its folder and SSH key).
.TP
.B search \fIname\fR
Find a lost project by name or language.
.TP
.B list
Show all registered projects.
.TP
.B doctor
Check the health of all registered projects.
.TP
.B stats
Show statistics for all projects.
.TP
.B backup
Archive all projects to the backup directory.
.TP
.B export \fIdest\fR
Export the registry to JSON.
.TP
.B import \fIsrc\fR
Import the registry from JSON.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-help
Show help message and exit.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Clone a repository and add an SSH key:
.nf
proman init git@github.com:user/repo.git --duration-key
.fi
.TP
Create a new project from a template:
.nf
proman new my-project --template python-basic
.fi
.TP
Run a project by substring:
.nf
proman run SimpleDocker
.fi
.SH AUTHOR
cleverel
